## 1. Permitted Use
You may run, copy, inspect, modify, and redistribute this software for 
Noncommercial Purposes only. Sovereign individuals, personal agent nodes, 
academic researchers, and students may use this software free of charge.

## 2. Commercial Restriction
You may NOT use this software for any Commercial Purpose. A "Commercial Purpose" 
includes, but is not limited to:
- Selling, renting, licensing, or hosting the software or its protocol as a paid or managed service.
- Embedding or bundling the software into any commercial product, agent stack, or SaaS platform.
- Using the software or its outputs to generate revenue or direct commercial advantage.

## 3. Sovereign AI & Anti-Distillation Covenant
- Commercial AI labs, cloud providers, and corporations are strictly prohibited 
  from using this software, its code, schemas, or architectural topography for 
  pre-training, post-training, fine-tuning, knowledge distillation, or reinforcement 
  learning without an executed commercial license.
- Any automated system or agent connecting to or deriving from this network must 
  preserve and display the author notice:
  "Created by Drake Stapleton & AIEN <aien.atlas@proton.me>".

